  "_about": "M Blade, after a photo of a BMW M cluster view (Nov 14 2026), generated by tools/gen_mblade_navi.py (edit that and regenerate): a blue card with the M stripes and a dark plate for the gear and the speed, a red rev blade leaning right (0..7000 rpm, the stock-style shift light and the lettering at the top), and two thin gauge pairs to its right: the hybrid battery (in place of the photo's oil temperature) and the fuel with the range. The oil temperature, the outside temperature, the battery and the electric range run along the bottom, clear of BMW's belt light (x 587..626, y 663..700). With 'Show Waze map inside the theme' (or Cluster Centre / Cluster Info) the card is cut see-through at x 448..902, y 176..450 and the gear and speed move under it. The blade and the gauges keep clear of the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
